<title>USA: Silverleaf Resorts sets up acquisition sub.</title>
<headline>Silverleaf Resorts sets up acquisition sub.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Silverleaf Resorts Inc said Monday it formed a new subsidiary, Silverleaf Resort Acquisitions Inc, to buy resorts and resort companies.</p>
<p>The company said Tom Franks, currently president of the timeshare industry's trade organization American Resort Development Association, will become president of the new subsidiary on September 1.</p>
<p>Silverleaf on June 12 completed its initial public offering of 3.5 million shares at $16 a share. Its stock closed at 15-1/2 last Thursday.</p>
</text>
